                {
                  "key": "owner",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "Filter to a single owner wallet (0x EVM address, case-insensitive). Returns every position held by that address. Composes with the other filters — for the wallet's COMPLETE set add status=all, minValueUsd=0, minPoolTvl=0, includeRisky=true.",
