            "description": "Every position held by a wallet. Omit `chainId` to search all enabled chains at once. This is the same `/v1/positions` list route with the `owner` filter plus the widest visibility params so nothing the wallet holds is filtered out. Paginate via `page` for wallets with >100 positions. Costs 1 unit per call."
          },
          "response": []
