    {
      "name": "Health (free)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health + indexing status",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Service health plus a per-integration indexing-status badge (one entry per enabled (chainId, protocol)). Free, no API key, unmetered.\n\nPer-integration fields:\n- `indexedBlock` — latest block the indexer has PROCESSED (synced head). If the indexer cannot be reached for a moment, the last successful reading is repeated for up to 5 minutes (`lagBlocks` is always recomputed against the live chain head, so a repeated block can only overstate the lag). `null` if the indexer reports nothing for the chain, or has been unreachable for longer than that.\n- `chainHeadBlock` — current chain tip, sourced from DeFiLlama (no RPC, no key). `null` when the chain has no DeFiLlama slug.\n- `lagBlocks` — `max(0, chainHeadBlock - indexedBlock)`; `null` when either side is unknown.\n- `lagSeconds` — `lagBlocks` × the chain's average block time, in seconds. An estimate; `null` whenever `lagBlocks` is.\n- `synced` — `true` when an indexed block exists AND lag is within the healthy threshold (or the chain head is unknown).\n- `status` — `healthy` | `degraded` | `unhealthy` | `not_deployed`.\n- `indexedUpToTimestamp` — time of the newest indexed event (epoch seconds); legacy field, kept for back-compat. Carried the same way as `indexedBlock`.\n\nResponse is cached + fail-soft server-side, so polling /health never blocks on or hammers the indexer."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK — healthy",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "health"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8"
                }
              ],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"service\": \"positions-backend\",\n  \"integrations\": [\n    {\n      \"chainId\": 1,\n      \"protocol\": \"uniswap-v4\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"indexedBlock\": 25372096,\n      \"indexedUpToTimestamp\": 1782278600,\n      \"chainHeadBlock\": 25372230,\n      \"lagBlocks\": 134,\n      \"lagSeconds\": 1608,\n      \"synced\": true,\n      \"status\": \"healthy\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-24T05:21:00.000Z\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "description": "Free, unauthenticated, unmetered. Feeds the client indexed-vs-chain-head block badge."
    }
